=begin pod

=head1 NAME

B<sample> - Small RakuDoc file for App::RakuDocToPDF

=head1 DESCRIPTION

This is an ordinary paragraph. It is deliberately long enough to demonstrate
basic line wrapping when rendered on a physical Letter or A4 page.

=head2 A LIST

=item First item for the initial renderer.

=item Second item with C<inline code> shown as ordinary visible text.

=head2 CODE

=begin code :lang<raku>
use App::RakuDocToPDF;

rakudoc-to-pdf('README.rakudoc');
=end code

=end pod
